id: pm-starter-7tp5
title: "Make the 2026.10.23 pm toolchain bump pass: the recipes test host double dropped the SDK's generic ReadPromise get signature"
description: ""
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-26T17:19:26.880Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-27T11:55:19.626Z"
