completed_at: "2026-10-27T00:45:07.000Z"
author: codex
resolution: "Complete the verified toolchain bump, matching generated outputs and retained exact-head CI receipts."
expected_result: The toolchain bump and fixture/generated-output corrections pass with tracker evidence and recorded exact-head CI.
actual_result: "Current main passes the strict test-source build, including the generic SDK get passthrough that caused TS2345 before the bump fix. The closure-owned recipes command also passed 6/6 with zero failures or skips. Its earlier aggregate linked run additionally selected an older duplicate with a 120-second runner limit, which timed out; that duplicate timeout is not passing evidence. REST confirms the original exact-head CI succeeded; all package source assertions and thresholds remain unchanged."
comments[17]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-26T17:19:42.879Z",codex,"Cause: pm-cli 2026.10.23 changed PmClient.get to a generic ReadPromise<GetResult, Options> signature (read-output contracts), so the recipes test hand-rolled peer-transition double (async get(id) returning Promise<GetResult>) no longer satisfied FailureFirstHost and the test build failed with TS2345 at test/recipes.test.ts(132,49).\nFix: keep the double delegating to the real SDK client but make its get wrapper a faithful generic passthrough (Options extends GetOptions & PmReadOutputOptions, forwarding id and options to reader.get); no casts, no widened double, no loosened assertions. CHANGELOG.md regenerated with the bumped pm-changelog, which now emits a Closed section for closed tracker items.\nEvidence: tsc -p tsconfig.test.json exits 0; node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/recipes.test.ts 6/6 pass; npm run release:check green locally (coverage-gate thresholds met, changelog up to date, attestation ok)."
  "2026-10-26T17:25:31.417Z",codex,"Fix commit 59d894b pushed to dependabot/npm_and_yarn/pm-toolchain-c2eb260544. CI green: test (22) https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/actions/runs/40367610067/job/121729458671 and test (26) https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/actions/runs/40367610067/job/121729459482, plus CodeQL, codeql, enable-auto-merge, Sourcery, CodeRabbit, Hound all green. PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/pull/159"
  "2026-10-26T17:25:41.957Z",codex,"Fix commit 59d894b pushed to dependabot/npm_and_yarn/pm-toolchain-c2eb260544. CI green: test (22) https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/actions/runs/40367610067/job/121729458671 and test (26) https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/actions/runs/40367610067/job/121729459482. PR: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-starter/pull/159"
  "2026-10-26T18:13:08.320Z",codex-agent,"Continuation: verified the generic SDK get wrapper and passing test execution. CI run 40368628388 fails only changelog:check because the new chore was recorded after regeneration. Reopened the existing chore, preserving its history. Regenerate after all tracker mutations, rerun release:check, and leave closure to the orchestrator."
  "2026-10-26T18:19:48.228Z",codex-agent,"Validation note: pm test with workspace snapshot and the package extension-install fixture replaces the shared source SDK dependency with a self-referential symlink. The snapshot recipe test then fails its packaged CLI assertion and typecheck cannot resolve the SDK. This is a test-runner isolation issue, not the generic get fix; restore dependencies with npm ci and run the full release gate in the package worktree. The changelog generator reads committed tracker snapshots, so commit tracker state before regenerating and checking it."
  "2026-10-26T18:25:01.197Z",codex-agent,Linked npm run typecheck passed through pm test with source workspace and schema context. Full release gates run directly in the package worktree to preserve dependency and identity isolation. Existing tracker items remain in progress for orchestrator verification.
  "2026-10-26T18:32:43.973Z",codex-agent,"Complete local npm run release:check passed with 193/193 tests, zero failures, cancellations or skips; unchanged configured coverage thresholds passed; production audit found zero vulnerabilities; package dry run, changelog check and publish attestation passed. Source-workspace pm test typecheck also passed. The original get wrapper fix is retained unchanged. The Bun release gate is now running; final tracker evidence and claim release will be committed before pushing this Dependabot branch."
  "2026-10-26T18:37:14.096Z",codex-agent,"Bun run release:check also passed with 193/193 tests, zero failures, cancellations or skips. Both complete launcher gates passed at unchanged thresholds, including packaged JSON and TOON recovery with no Git executable. The only remaining edits are tracker evidence and claim release; no further source changes were needed."
  "2026-10-27T10:34:34.434Z",codex-agent,"Closure audit of current main: The merged Dependabot PR contains the toolchain fix, tracker receipts and generated-output changes. Current-main files were inspected; exact-head CI success is recovered in a new comment, and changelog generation/check follows closure writes. The peer-transition wrapper retains the generic Options extends GetOptions & PmReadOutputOptions signature and delegates options to the real SDK get; no casts, fake SDK responses or weakened assertions were introduced. Delivered by PR #159, merge commit e0d51a7fca9e73b708fb36b9a6d9473db835227a, merged_at 2026-10-27T00:45:07Z. Focused verification follows; full npm and Bun release gates are delegated to PR CI for this tracker-only change."
