  "2026-10-27T10:49:00.753Z",codex-agent,"Focused runtime receipt: the closure-owned node --test --test-concurrency=2 test/recipes.test.ts entry passed 6/6 in the linked runner, including packed non-git JSON/TOON recovery and the 500-sequence model. A substring selector also ran an older duplicate that exceeded its 120-second wrapper limit, making the aggregate invocation fail. The selector is corrected to one exact list index; only the successful 6-case command is accepted as runtime evidence. The added duplicate link is removed, original links are preserved, and npm run build:test verifies the actual generic SDK fixture signature without re-running the unchanged long model."
